A '''Collector''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンコレクター''' ''Pokémon Collector'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in the [[Generation III]] games. They are generally depicted as nerdy young men carrying many [[Poké Ball]]s.

In Generations III, {{gen|VI}}, and {{gen|VII}}, they use [[version-exclusive Pokémon]]. In {{2v2|Diamond|Pearl}} and in {{2v2|Brilliant Diamond|Shining Pearl}}, they use three Pokémon of the same species, while in {{v2|Platinum}} they use rare Pokémon such as {{p|Togetic}} or {{p|Feebas}}. They often talk about how they wish to catch rare Pokémon.

In [[Generation I]], one of [[Bill]]'s titles was ''the'' Collector.

In [[Generation VII]], they keep their Pokémon in [[Premier Ball]]s.

